+ * </p>
+ * <pre>{@code
+ * "left hand"                 "right hand"
+ * | lhdata |             | positions | r1 | r2 |
+ * ----------             -----------------------
+ * |    l00 |                    last page
+ * |    l01 |             |        96 |  1 |  2 |
+ * |    ... |             |        97 |  1 |  2 |
+ * |    l99 |
+ * }</pre>
+ * <p>
+ *     Which makes:
+ * </p>
+ * <pre>{@code
+ * | lhdata  |  r1  |  r2  |
+ * -------------------------
